年人工智慧合約目標提升至 17 億美元，代理採用率激增 13 倍 - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"ServiceNow Lifts 2026 AI Booking Target to $1.7 Billion as Guidance Miss and Job Cuts Weigh on Share - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-20","zh":"由於指導缺失和裁員影響份額，ServiceNow 將 2026 年人工智慧預訂目標提高至 17 億美元 - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"ServiceNow Sheds 13% in a Week as AI Enthusiasm Cools and Bookings Outlook Disappoints - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-20","zh":"由於人工智慧熱情降溫且預訂前景令人失望，ServiceNow 一周內下跌 13% - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"ServiceNow's India AI Survey Exposes a Security Gap as Bookings Guidance Falls Short - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-20","zh":"ServiceNow 的印度人工智慧調查暴露了預訂指導不達標的安全漏洞 - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"Is ServiceNow (NYSE:NOW) Raising Guidance on AI Demand?","src":"Kalkine Media","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPZjN0LVJWRDZoYTV3T3p6VFYwZVZTbktlTWNNSzNIQUp4R2NkeGF5bW0yX1BNeElaQ2RDaHVjQl9Jc0ZDWW5OeU01SlVWNF8yeGZwaTduMVE4Q1RnYXEyMUlOcU1FZ1l4R2ZObmR1V3lpT3p5bTBZNFBodl80djNiMVlVWTZGZGlaRUlVcXoxekZiQlB5dThYYQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"ServiceNow（NYSE：NOW）是否提高了人工智慧需求的指導？"},{"title":"Can ServiceNow Stock Jump 50%?","src":"Trefis","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPZ05vUlpKWVBCc2JKenBWcUkwQ3R6SExFTEhrdGgtOVlUZllKVVRVTGtncGlqblQxbWF2ZGV4QktsdFU3OFk2aE1pTjByR1dLbnVmYVQ5WktxUWVmZlFfdlBFQm45U2E4YnRJT21vaFlLMHNSODJpdElnWVdTeFp4WG9wN3VaMVB6M0JZWGtaQjlxQQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-18","zh":"ServiceNow 股價能否上漲 50%？"},{"title":"ServiceNow Just Dropped 35% in a Month on a Backlog Guide. Dan Ives Calls the Selloffs “Violent Air Pockets”","src":"TIKR.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxNUEFNYTZWWmxITmk4cS1MMEw5QkJUaU1lN3pzQlRENHE4emxxUTZFMUcwR0tQSU4yZU42TkV3cy1kdmdiQjBBUWQ3RkhsNDF6MXBDV2JzS2Y2OUpTdE9rbDJxVzlHdkMwaGZKVFBSSzM1RUtuUjY4eXBOVlZhTzFNWFJVdGNYb1o4b3I0RG93M20zaWtYNDhzZE5qcUd5WUY0blJOZTctcXRHWk1GWU50MjVRNWJqN1hKWDF2Q1RBU25hR1F0SGNTTWNkRQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-18","zh":"ServiceNow 的積壓指南在一個月內下降了 35%。丹·艾夫斯稱拋售為“暴力空氣袋”"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":6},{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"裁員/重組","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-01-29","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1373715/000137371526000007/now-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"ServiceNow delivers solutions that help public and private organizations govern, secure and manage artificial intelligence and digitalize and streamline workflows to drive collaboration, productivity and better experiences across the enterprise. We offer an innovative suite of products, including AI-powered applications, and services designed to automate workflows, integrate systems and empower employees, regardless of existing systems, cloud environments or collaboration tools. At the core of these solutions is the ServiceNow AI Platform, a robust, cloud-based platform that facilitates comprehensive delivery of seamless workflows and drives digital transformation across all departments and personas within an organization.","zh":"ServiceNow 提供的解決方案可協助公共和私人組織治理、保護和管理人工智慧，並數位化和簡化工作流程，以推動整個企業的協作、生產力和更好的體驗。我們提供一套創新的產品，包括人工智慧驅動的應用程式和服務，旨在自動化工作流程、整合系統並為員工提供支持，無論現有系統、雲端環境或協作工具如何。這些解決方案的核心是 ServiceNow AI 平台，這是一個基於雲端的強大平台，可促進無縫工作流程的全面交付，並推動組織內所有部門和角色的數位轉型。"},{"en":"With the emergence of artificial intelligence, organizations are under pressure from their stakeholders to accelerate growth and achieve unprecedented productivity improvements. To meet these demands, they are prioritizing the digitalization and modernization of their workflows through AI-powered automation. At the same time, they are seeking secure and reliable tools to manage the heightened risks associated with AI innovation and ensure measurable returns on investment. ServiceNow addresses these evolving organizational needs by providing solutions that help organizations govern, secure, and manage artificial intelligence, while optimizing their workflows.","zh":"隨著人工智慧的出現，組織面臨來自利害關係人的壓力，要求其加速成長並實現前所未有的生產力提高。為了滿足這些需求，他們優先考慮透過人工智慧驅動的自動化來實現工作流程的數位化和現代化。同時，他們正在尋求安全可靠的工具來管理與人工智慧創新相關的高風險，並確保可衡量的投資回報。 ServiceNow 透過提供協助組織治理、保護和管理人工智慧的解決方案來滿足這些不斷變化的組織需求，同時優化其工作流程。"},{"en":"We operate in a dynamic and rapidly evolving technology landscape characterized by the accelerating adoption of artificial intelligence and machine learning capabilities across enterprise software. While this period of technological transformation presents both opportunities and uncertainties reminiscent of prior inflection points—such as the shift from on-premises to cloud computing in the early 2010s and the advent of mobile computing before that—we believe our established market position, deep customer relationships, and platform capabilities position us favorably to capitalize on these emerging needs. We have invested in understanding evolving customer requirements through ongoing dialogue with our customer base, which spans diverse industries and use cases, and we have developed our platform to address the practical challenges enterprises encounter when","zh":"我們在一個動態且快速發展的技術環境中運營，其特點是整個企業軟體中人工智慧和機器學習功能的加速採用。雖然這段技術轉型時期既帶來了機遇，也帶來了不確定性，讓人想起之前的拐點（例如 2010 年代初期從本地計算到雲端運算的轉變以及在此之前行動運算的出現），但我們相信，我們既定的市場地位、深厚的客戶關係和平台能力使我們能夠有利地利用這些新興需求。我們透過與跨越不同行業和用例的客戶群的持續對話來了解不斷變化的客戶需求，並且我們開發了我們的平台來解決企業在以下情況下遇到的實際挑戰："}],"markets":[{"en":"Our products are grouped into four areas: Technology, Customer Relationship Management (\"CRM\") and Industry, Core Business, and Creator and Other. We release two major Platform upgrades each year, adding new products and functionality that simplify work and enhance productivity.","zh":"我們的產品分為四個領域：技術、客戶關係管理（「CRM」）和產業、核心業務以及創造者和其他。我們每年發布兩次主要的平台升級，增加新產品和功能，以簡化工作並提高生產力。"},{"en":"Our Technology products help companies unite technology, risk management and security operations on a single platform to deliver modern and resilient digital services aligned to an organization's priorities.","zh":"我們的技術產品可協助公司將技術、風險管理和安全營運整合在一個平台上，以提供符合組織優先事項的現代化且有彈性的數位服務。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We primarily sell our services to enterprise customers and support enterprise-wide deployments. As of December 31, 2025, we had approximately 8,700 customers across a wide variety of industries. A growing portion of our revenue is generated from sales to government customers. For additional information, see \"Risk Factors—Doing business with the public sector and heavily-regulated entities subjects us to risks related to government procurement processes, regulations and contracting requirements.\"","zh":"我們主要向企業客戶銷售服務並支援企業範圍內的部署。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們在各行各業擁有約 8,700 名客戶。我們越來越多的收入來自向政府客戶的銷售。有關更多資訊，請參閱“風險因素 - 與公共部門和受到嚴格監管的實體開展業務會使我們面臨與政府採購流程、法規和合同要求相關的風險。”"},{"en":"We sell our products and services to enterprises across a wide variety of industries through subscription agreements facilitated by our global direct sales organization. In addition to subscription offerings, certain AI and data solutions include a consumption-based pricing component that governs when customer usage exceeds the fixed number of service credits available under the customer's subscription agreement. We also sell through managed service providers and resale partners.","zh":"我們透過全球直銷組織推動的訂閱協議向各行業的企業銷售我們的產品和服務。除了訂閱服務之外，某些人工智慧和數據解決方案還包括基於消費的定價元件，該元件在客戶使用量超過客戶訂閱協議下可用的固定服務積分數量時進行管理。我們也透過託管服務提供者和轉售合作夥伴進行銷售。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a highly competitive and rapidly evolving market characterized by fragmentation, low barriers to entry, shifting customer needs and frequent introductions of new products and services. As our business expands and the industries in which we operate continue to evolve, we compete with a broad range of solutions and alternative approaches, including:","zh":"我們在一個競爭激烈且快速發展的市場中運營，其特點是分散、進入障礙低、客戶需求不斷變化以及頻繁推出新產品和服務。隨著我們業務的擴展和我們經營的行業的不斷發展，我們與各種解決方案和替代方法競爭，包括："},{"en":"enterprise application software vendors, both cloud-based and on-premises, such as Microsoft, Oracle, SAP, Salesforce and Workday;","zh":"企業應用軟體供應商，包括基於雲端的和本地的，例如 Microsoft、Oracle、SAP、Salesforce 和 Workday；"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"License & Service","val":12883000000,"zh":"許可與服務"},{"name":"Technology Service","val":395000000,"zh":"技術服務"}],"total":13278000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":8348000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":3402000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific & Other","val":1528000000,"zh":"亞太及其他地區"}],"total":13278000000}},"peers":["CRM","CRWD","PANW","SNOW","ADBE"]}}